# bloghub

Tag handling for bloghub.

Helpers in src/tags.js never modify their arguments: the caller's arrays are left exactly as passed. The render pipeline relies on this because it reuses the same tag list for the cloud and for the alphabetical index.

## Sidebar

sidebar(tags) returns the tag cloud (top tags by count) and the "recent" strip, which is the first few tags in the order they were given. It takes the cloud first, then the recent strip from the same array, so topTags must not reorder that array in place.

## Font sizes

fontSize(count, max) buckets a tag into one of five sizes by its share of the maximum count. The top tag is xl, a zero count is xs.

